# DUST devnet config — copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env.
# No secrets are required for the devnet tests. Test wallets are generated
# locally into devnet/ (gitignored) and funded from the devnet faucet.
#
# RPC options (in order of preference):
#   1. Solana devnet:        https://api.devnet.solana.com   (may be unreachable
#      from restricted runtimes — the E2E then falls back to option 2)
#   2. Local test validator:  http://localhost:8899           (identical Solana
#      programs; run: solana-test-validator --reset)
# Mainnet URLs are REFUSED by every chain script — mainnet is never allowed.
RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# RPC_URL=http://localhost:8899
